Bazel sandboxes hide this crate's CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR from usearch's C++
compile. Copy headers into OUT_DIR so cargo:include is a build-script
output; rules_rust then sets DEP_NUMKONG_INCLUDE as an action input of
dependents (same pattern as libz-sys).

